WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:05.400
Genie 4 is our most realistic and interactive world model yet.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:09.400
Build environments and simulate worlds on command.

00:00:10.100 --> 00:00:14.400
Keep prompting and Genie 4 will work out what happens next.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:19.600
Then explore and reshape them in real time.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Transform a picture into a dynamic environment that's ready to explore,

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:41.000
complete with ambient sound.

00:00:52.400 --> 00:00:56.400
Create a scene, move the camera, direct every detail.

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:04.300
And watch the world change, live.

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:06.600
Do you really think we're going to make it?

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:16.200
Or describe an interactive experience.

00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:20.100
A few seconds later, you're inside it,

00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:22.700
with full control over your character.

00:01:22.900 --> 00:01:25.400
Hey! Let's attack the castle!

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:28.800
No! It's a trap!
